# Per-Dockerfile ignore file: `<Dockerfile>.dockerignore` takes precedence over
# a context-root `.dockerignore`, keeping every Docker artifact under docker/.
#
# This image COPYs exactly one context path — docker/install-sidecars.sh — and
# mounts the UI sources at runtime (docker/compose.dev.yaml), so send nothing
# else. `*` + the explicit negations keep the repo-root context at a few KB
# instead of the whole source tree.
*
!docker/
!docker/install-sidecars.sh
